cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use MuftGo Billing in research, cite the exact release or commit you
  evaluated together with these project metadata. MuftGo Billing is a
  white-label fork of Posnic POS (https://github.com/Posnic/POS).
title: MuftGo Billing
type: software
abstract: >-
  MuftGo Billing is zero-price, offline-first open source billing software
  for retail shops, based on Posnic POS source (AGPL-3.0-only).
  Release packages include separately licensed components, including MongoDB
  Community Server under SSPL-1.0. Its primary API and database run on the shop
  computer or on a server you control, with optional external payment, cloud,
  and integration dependencies.
authors:
  - name: MuftGo
repository-code: https://github.com/jayp120/MuftGo-Billing
url: https://muftgo.com/
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 1.6.1
date-released: 2026-08-28
keywords:
  - point of sale
  - POS software
  - open source POS
  - offline POS
  - online/offline POS
  - offline-first
  - retail
